    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm Dodge is a twin-stick, retro styled music based game where instead of hitting notes to the rhythm of the music, you have to dodge them. You play as two sides that you control independently. Making you test your eye-hand coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/badaefde24ab344ad84b17b474e9a6ba.avif?t=1748925228\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Dodge the Beat in this compact experience!</strong> \ud83c\udfb5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through varying patterns in levels with a variety of music, difficulty and colors while taking control of 2 sides, to beat your highscores. You only have a limited amount of hits you can take before you have to start over, so keep a lookout for healing items spread throughout the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Accessibility &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebind keys to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn off visual effects like screenshake for a more comfortable experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable toggled lane switching.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80<strong>Beat the Developer Score!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once you are ready, head into the level select, where for a  challenging experience where you can increase the scroll speed of the level you want to play, for a major score bonus. There are multiple developer scores waiting to be beaten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/ef556b7e2c4c6fae72732e8b7af21249.poster.avif?t=1748925228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/ef556b7e2c4c6fae72732e8b7af21249.webm?t=1748925228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/ef556b7e2c4c6fae72732e8b7af21249.mp4?t=1748925228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/dfed268918f5df3f5cbaa12f75240608.webp?t=1748925228\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm Dodge is a twin-stick, retro styled music based game where instead of hitting notes to the rhythm of the music, you have to dodge them. You play as two sides that you control independently. Making you test your eye-hand coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/badaefde24ab344ad84b17b474e9a6ba.avif?t=1748925228\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Dodge the Beat in this compact experience!</strong> \ud83c\udfb5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through varying patterns in levels with a variety of music, difficulty and colors while taking control of 2 sides, to beat your highscores. You only have a limited amount of hits you can take before you have to start over, so keep a lookout for healing items spread throughout the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Accessibility &amp; Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebind keys to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn off visual effects like screenshake for a more comfortable experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable toggled lane switching.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80<strong>Beat the Developer Score!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once you are ready, head into the level select, where for a  challenging experience where you can increase the scroll speed of the level you want to play, for a major score bonus. There are multiple developer scores waiting to be beaten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/ef556b7e2c4c6fae72732e8b7af21249.poster.avif?t=1748925228\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/ef556b7e2c4c6fae72732e8b7af21249.webm?t=1748925228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/ef556b7e2c4c6fae72732e8b7af21249.mp4?t=1748925228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502400/extras/dfed268918f5df3f5cbaa12f75240608.webp?t=1748925228\" /></span></p>",
